@startuml Feature_UseCase

actor User
participant "Serial-SPI\nBridge Board" as Bridge
participant "SPI Target\nDevice" as Target

== SPI Configuration Use Case ==
User -> Bridge: Send serial request:\nConfigure SPI (mode, clock, CS)
Bridge -> Bridge: Save configuration\nto non-volatile storage
Bridge --> User: Serial response:\nConfiguration successful

== SPI Write Use Case ==
User -> Bridge: Send serial request:\nWrite data to SPI device
Bridge -> Target: SPI transfer (MOSI)\nwith configured parameters
Target --> Bridge: SPI response (MISO)
Bridge --> User: Serial response:\nWrite successful

== SPI Read Use Case ==
User -> Bridge: Send serial request:\nRead data from SPI device
Bridge -> Target: SPI transfer (clock + CS)
Target --> Bridge: SPI data (MISO)
Bridge --> User: Serial response:\nRead data bytes

note right of User
  User communicates with SPI
  peripherals (displays, flash,
  sensors) via simple serial commands
end note

@enduml